<key_info>RPC Streaming Architecture - Build Issue Analysis:

**Root Cause**: Type incompatibility between pkg/endpoint and pkg/endpoint/cep middleware builders
- internal/client/option.go declares: StreamMWBs []endpoint.StreamMiddlewareBuilder  
- client/option_stream.go passes: cep.StreamMiddlewareBuilder
- These are DIFFERENT types with incompatible signatures:
  * endpoint.StreamMiddleware: func(next StreamEndpoint) StreamEndpoint (uses endpoint.StreamEndpoint = endpoint.Endpoint)
  * cep.StreamMiddleware: func(next cep.StreamEndpoint) cep.StreamEndpoint (uses cep.StreamEndpoint based on streaming.ClientStream)

**Solution Path**: Change internal/client/option.go to use cep types instead of endpoint types for streaming middleware, since client-side streaming uses cep (client endpoint package).

**Additional Issues**:
- TTStreamOptions field missing from internal/client/Options (option_ttstream.go references it)

**Progress**: Target 6 frame_reader.go complete. All other targets done. Only fixing type system now.</key_info>
